      "text": "Unfurl prototip v2 (Play ile tıklayın):\n0. Sign in → Create account → Check your inbox → Onboarding\n1. Applications = ana sayfa: özet (Rejected dahil), Needs attention, kartları sürükle, Add job\n2. Kranich Health → Apply: ① Should I apply? ② Prepare documents ③ Final check\n3. Learning → Today / Next 7 days / All tasks / Catch-up, New goal, Add task\n4. Documents → CVs / Cover letters, profile strength\n5. Sağ alttaki ✨ = Assistant (her sayfada). Sağ üst JN = My profile.\n\nMenü: Applications · Learning · Documents · Settings\nTüm şirketler ve kişi (Jana Novak) örnek veridir."
